OL,3,AFamily of teenager killed in crash to
OL,4,Asue acquitted driver
OL,5,
OL,6,FGray, who had passed his test a month
OL,7,Fearlier, was acquitted of causing the
OL,8,Fdeaths of his two friends after a
OL,9,Ffive-day trial at Stirling Sheriff
OL,10,FCourt last November.
OL,12,FAccording to the Scottish Sun, the
OL,13,FMarshall family are now suing Gray for
OL,14,Fa six-figure sum, alleging negligence.
